it.edu/recreationwellness/facilities/red-barn","source_title":"Red Barn | Recreation and Wellness | RIT","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"RIT community access requires proper ID and an annual release; visitors may not climb or spot.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rit-tennis-courts","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"RIT Tennis Courts","title":"RIT Tennis Courts","subtitle":"Near U-Lot","notes":"Bring a partner and appropriate equipment for a casual game, while checking recreation schedules for availability around intramurals or campus events.","short_summary":"Nine lighted outdoor courts used for recreation, wellness, intramurals, and events.","evidence_claim":"RIT states that its tennis courts near U-Lot are used for athletics, wellness, recreation, intramurals, and major campus events.","source_url":"https://www.rit.edu/wellness","source_title":"Wellness | RIT","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Court use can be affected by recreation schedules, reservations, intramurals, and major campus events.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"rit-quads","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"The Quads","title":"The Quads","subtitle":"RIT outdoor campus spaces","notes":"Use a blanket, book, or a small group meet-up outdoors, and watch campus announcements for activities that take place in these open areas.","short_summary":"Open campus areas used for relaxing, studying, and campus events.","evidence_claim":"An RIT admissions article describes the Quads as outdoor spaces for relaxing, studying, and participating in campus events.","source_url":"https://www.rit.edu/admissions/blog/best-spots-hang-out-rit","source_title":"The Best Spots to Hang Out at RIT","source